<title>USA: TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OKLAHOMA CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY, Oklahoma 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $164,250 IGA Tennis Classic on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>3-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Lindsay Lee (U.S.) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>4-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Alexia Dechaume-Balleret (France)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>5-Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Kyoko Nagatsuka (Japan) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Pam Shriver (U.S.) beat Rene Simpson (Canada) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
